{
  "slug": "hit-em-with-the-docs",
  "name": "Hit Em With The Docs",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Self-managing documentation system with a 15-domain hierarchy, 22-field metadata schema, intelligent pattern discovery, and GitHub Actions automation. Generates and maintains hierarchical documentation with rich metadata, auto-discovers undocumented patterns, and self-heals stale or missing docs. Available as both a CLI tool and GitHub Action for CI/CD integration.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **4 commands** and **1 hook**.\n\n- **Commands** (4): `policy` (Get or set the hit-em-with-the-docs update policy (auto | nudge | off)), `relink` (Re-run the skill linker — refresh symlinks from node_modules into .claude/skills/), `status` (Show installed version, latest available version, current update policy, and hook registration state), `update` (Update hit-em-with-the-docs to the latest version (runs npm update))\n- **Hooks** (1): `SessionStart`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install hit-em-with-the-docs@claude-community` from `TheGlitchKing/hit-em-with-the-docs`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "hook": 1,
    "command": 4
  },
  "sourceType": "community",
